#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"A ``conversation.conversation`` is one recorded call, meeting or field visit: who\n"
"is responsible, the customer, the people known to take part, and its recordings\n"
"as a media timeline. It is a business record over the import cycle, not a\n"
"pipeline of its own:\n"
"\n"
"- **Transcription** is ``speech``'s: each recording is a segment, transcribed by\n"
"  whichever engine the company's ``gateway_ml`` policy allows for\n"
"  ``speech.transcription.<kind>`` (sensitive), or on the server by\n"
"  ``speech_local``. Domain vocabulary (``speech.vocabulary``, extended here with\n"
"  crops and active ingredients) travels as key terms. How long the audio is kept\n"
"  is ``conversation.retention.policy``; the transcript outlives it.\n"
"- **Voices** are ``speech.speaker`` rows, named after the attendees, by the\n"
"  analyst's guesses, by elimination, by employee name, or by\n"
"  ``speech_voiceprint`` when it is installed.\n"
"- **Analysis** is ``speech_analysis``'s, under the ``conversation`` schema, which\n"
"  inherits ``speech_analysis`` and adds the outcome, recommendations and proposed\n"
"  actions. The analyst reads a context header -- the company's\n"
"  ``analysis_context``, the known people, the vocabulary, the tool catalog --\n"
"  before the transcript, under the purpose ``speech.analysis.conversation``.\n"
"- **Proposed actions** are ``ai.tool.call`` rows of the catalog's tools\n"
"  (``ir.actions.server`` flagged ``conversation_enabled``). Each tool names the\n"
"  approval category that decides it -- the person in charge, a leader, a\n"
"  manager -- and runs, once approved, as the person it was proposed for. The\n"
"  generic create and update tools write only what ``ai.tool.model.access``\n"
"  allows.\n"
"\n"
"``conversation_meeting`` adds the meeting room and live coaching,\n"
"``conversation_mobile`` the company phones, and ``conversation_sale``,\n"
"``_purchase``, ``_mrp`` and ``_account`` their own tools.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_account
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Accounting\n"
"==========================\n"
"\n"
"Adds the Accounting tools to the conversation catalog. Installs itself when both\n"
"``conversation`` and ``account`` are present.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_mobile
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Company Phones\n"
"==============================\n"
"\n"
"Bridge between ``device_mobile_speech`` and ``conversation``. When the companion\n"
"app uploads a call recording, a ``conversation.conversation`` of kind *call* is\n"
"created with the customer the call log matched, the phone's user as the\n"
"responsible (none when the handset has no user) and both as attendees, and the\n"
"recording becomes its segment. A recording whose call log has not arrived waits\n"
"up to forty minutes before it is transcribed, so the analysis knows the other\n"
"party; the call log's arrival starts it at once, with the customer, the name\n"
"and the attendee it brings. The conversation keeps its phone and call log after\n"
"the recording row itself is vacuumed.\n"
"\n"
"A ``device.device`` gains a *Phone user*: the employee who carries the handset.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_mrp
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Manufacturing\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Adds the Manufacturing tools to the conversation catalog. Installs itself when both\n"
"``conversation`` and ``mrp`` are present.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_meeting
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Meetings\n"
"========================\n"
"\n"
"A calendar event starts (or reopens) its conversation with its attendees, and\n"
"the meeting-room device (a ``device.device`` in the *Meeting Room* category, the\n"
"only category these routes accept) uploads the recording to\n"
"``/conversation/<id>/audio`` with its Bearer token, the same inbound gate company\n"
"phones use. While it records it can stream 15-second chunks to\n"
"``/conversation/<id>/chunk``. A conversation is a ``mixin.media.live``\n"
"timeline (``speech``): each chunk is a live segment with its own high-priority\n"
"transcription job, and the moderator's form follows the words over the bus on\n"
"``speech.live/conversation.conversation/<id>``, which the websocket layer serves\n"
"only to people who can read the conversation. Every few chunks a\n"
"job asks the coach -- through ``gateway_ml``, under the sensitive purpose\n"
"``speech.analysis.coach`` -- for notices, kept as ``conversation.coaching.note``.\n"
"The final recording replaces the chunks. ``tools/record-room.sh`` is the\n"
"room-side script: audio preflight, moderator confirmation, ffmpeg recording\n"
"(Opus) and upload.\n"
"\n"
"Once analyzed, the conversation exports a Markdown minute in the layout the\n"
"team already reads (Contexto, Temas, Decisiones, Action Items, Tareas Odoo).\n"
msgstr ""

